Dialogue: 5,0:00:00.09,0:00:02.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Japan news in eighty\Nseconds.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Here are three updates,\Nchecked
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}on October second.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}First, Japan has begun\Nrecovering
Dialogue: 5,0:00:08.52,0:00:10.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}a Global Hawk\Nsurveillance drone
Dialogue: 5,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}from the sea off Tottori.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.52,0:00:14.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Associated Press reports\Nthat it
Dialogue: 5,0:00:14.41,0:00:16.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}disappeared in mid\NSeptember.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.88,0:00:17.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}What may be its main
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.85,0:00:19.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}body was located about\Ntwo
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.41,0:00:21.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}hundred to three hundred\Nmeters
Dialogue: 5,0:00:21.01,0:00:22.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}underwater.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:22.60,0:00:24.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Details remain limited.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Second, Economy Minister\NMinoru Kiuchi
Dialogue: 5,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}says Japan no longer\Nneeds
Dialogue: 5,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}excessively loose\Nmonetary policy now
Dialogue: 5,0:00:31.79,0:00:32.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}that it has moved beyond
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}deflation.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Reuters reports he\Nstressed that
Dialogue: 5,0:00:36.11,0:00:37.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}interest rate decisions\Nbelong to
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.78,0:00:39.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the Bank of Japan.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.71,0:00:40.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}He declined to say\Nwhether
Dialogue: 5,0:00:40.95,0:00:42.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the government opposed\Nadditional rate
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.65,0:00:44.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}increases.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:44.21,0:00:46.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}That is a minister's\Nposition,
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.04,0:00:47.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}not a new central bank
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.30,0:00:48.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}rate decision.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.10,0:00:52.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Third, business sentiment\Nis mixed.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.14,0:00:53.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}In its October first\NTankan
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.69,0:00:55.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}release, the Bank of\NJapan
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.50,0:00:57.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}reported large\Nmanufacturers at plus
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.66,0:00:59.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}twenty four, up from plus
Dialogue: 5,0:00:59.49,0:01:01.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}twenty two in June.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:01.43,0:01:03.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Large nonmanufacturers\Nslipped from
Dialogue: 5,0:01:03.39,0:01:04.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}plus thirty seven to plus
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}thirty five.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.32,0:01:08.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}These are sentiment index\Nreadings,
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.43,0:01:10.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}not growth rates.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.25,0:01:12.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}The survey measures\Nfavorable responses
Dialogue: 5,0:01:12.25,0:01:14.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}minus unfavorable\Nresponses.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:15.10,0:01:18.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}Sources: Associated\NPress, Reuters, and
Dialogue: 5,0:01:18.05,0:01:19.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(35,35)}the Bank of Japan.
